      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `3f524e10cad74c5b106e572a97cae41a66d165da83e231306d20d61dcc3fa6af--3.-Victims-of-crime-relationship-of-offender-to-victims-Tables-17-to-22-.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Recorded Crime — Victims (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2020\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 7 of 7\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | 6c3d9609f920e6fa98da5d61bf33e09172d856380184b95d50124e7eaf77b976 | missing |\n| \"Table 17\" | f6442d46973c83a8e0f675fe13e5ed2bbf56ecd3f913603d372486b3ac22a17b | missing |\n| \"Table 18\" | 66ab104c20f0da9ef3d955fa7d8a24ebd89daf9bbd12f08b1dcf63e86880b9fd | missing |\n| \"Table 19\" | 39fd3f692c312ef280cfdcc451ceb3ab95f8f11a54f73c6d95f2afca581e30dd | missing |\n| \"Table 20\" | 8478859d01311025aceeb980119e4d645ed7bf78c9bd398caf161a33d6a42a0a | missing |\n| \"Table 21\" | 725bf7d69b2134cb48b63a8a8d54cc60994bd74bdace3aa583d00cd7e8fb0f19 | missing |\n| \"Table 22\" | 9bab0f4ceb4fb9c72dfcb8d9a30e328083827ff31ce0b2d634561039a3b95ff3 | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
